       The program below can be used to show the default _m_q___m_a_x_m_s_g and
       _m_q___m_s_g_s_i_z_e values that are assigned to a message queue that is created
       with a call to mmqq__ooppeenn(3) in which the _a_t_t_r argument is NULL.  Here is
       an example run of the program:

           $ ..//aa..oouutt //tteessttqq;
